{"seq":3,"slug":"cumulation-de-minimis-qualification-service","title":"累积规则、de minimis 阈值与 SKU 资格引擎服务化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fta-preference-utilization-duty-savings-engineering/sku-origin-qualification-engine/cumulation-de-minimis-qualification-service","wordCount":2955,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"累积规则-de-minimis-阈值与-sku-资格引擎服务化\">累积规则、de minimis 阈值与 SKU 资格引擎服务化</h1><p>一个在越南组装的蓝牙音箱，外壳来自马来西亚、电池来自中国、芯片来自日本，装进同一只集装箱发往欧盟和墨西哥。若只看&quot;非原产材料占比&quot;，引擎会判它非原产；但换一条路径——把马来西亚外壳按<strong>对角累积</strong>认作区内原产，把低于阈值的中国电池按 <strong>de minimis</strong> 忽略——同一个 SKU 就跨过了资格线。累积（cumulation）与最小容忍（de minimis）是原产地判定里仅有的两个**能把&quot;非原产&quot;洗成&quot;原产&quot;**的机制，也是资格引擎从&quot;一次性算分&quot;走向&quot;服务化决策&quot;的真正驱动因素。</p>\n<p>上一篇 <a href=\"origin-rule-qualification-model\">原产地规则判定模型</a> 讲判定内核（完全获得、CTC、RVC、最小操作）；本文讲内核之上的两层：<strong>累积规则如何改变投入品的国别归属</strong>，<strong>de minimis 如何在阈值内豁免单个非原产材料</strong>，以及把两者做成可缓存、可审计、可版本化的资格引擎服务。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>累积解决的是&quot;<strong>投入品算哪国</strong>&quot;，de minimis 解决的是&quot;<strong>多小的非原产成分可以不算</strong>&quot;。二者不是同一条规则的两种写法，而是判定流程上<strong>顺序相邻的两道过滤器</strong>：累积先重写每个投入品的原产地标签，de minimis 再对残余的非原产材料做一次从价或按重量的豁免。顺序颠倒会直接改变结果——先用 de minimis 抹掉一个 9% 的日本零件，再想用累积把它计入区内价值，已经晚了。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>NonOriginating</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><mtext>Originating</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>∨</mo><mtext> Cumulated</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{NonOriginating}(i) = \\neg\\Big(\\text{Originating}(i) \\ \\lor\\ \\text{Cumulated}(i)\\Big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NonOriginating</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">¬</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Originating</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∨</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cumulated</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mtext>VNM</mtext><mtext>eff</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>NonOriginating</mtext></mrow></munder><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mtext>pass</mtext><mtext>dm</mtext></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mfrac><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mtext>VNM</mtext><mtext>eff</mtext></msubsup><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>FOB</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{VNM}}^{\\text{eff}} = \\sum_{i \\in \\text{NonOriginating}} v_i , \\qquad \\text{pass}_{\\text{dm}} \\iff \\frac{V_{\\text{VNM}}^{\\text{eff}}}{V_{\\text{FOB}}} \\le \\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1461em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">VNM</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4804em;vertical-align:-1.4304em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">NonOriginating</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4304em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pass</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dm</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3621em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5261em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">FOB</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4247em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">VNM</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2753em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Cumulated</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Cumulated}(i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cumulated</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 表示投入品 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的原产国落在本次判定启用的<strong>累积集合</strong>内，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 是该协定/该品类的容忍阈值。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[SKU BOM 展开] --&gt; B[逐投入品查原产国]&#10;  B --&gt; C{原产国 ∈ 累积集合?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[重标为区内原产&lt;br/&gt;并入累积价值]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| E[保留为非原产材料]&#10;  D --&gt; F[计算 RVC / 比对 CTC]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G{已满足 PSR?}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| Z[判定原产]&#10;  G --&gt;|否| H{启用 de minimis?}&#10;  H --&gt;|否| N[判定非原产]&#10;  H --&gt;|是| I{非原产材料在阈值内?}&#10;  I --&gt;|是| Z&#10;  I --&gt;|否| N\">graph TD\n  A[SKU BOM 展开] --&gt; B[逐投入品查原产国]\n  B --&gt; C{原产国 ∈ 累积集合?}\n  C --&gt;|是| D[重标为区内原产&lt;br/&gt;并入累积价值]\n  C --&gt;|否| E[保留为非原产材料]\n  D --&gt; F[计算 RVC / 比对 CTC]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G{已满足 PSR?}\n  G --&gt;|是| Z[判定原产]\n  G --&gt;|否| H{启用 de minimis?}\n  H --&gt;|否| N[判定非原产]\n  H --&gt;|是| I{非原产材料在阈值内?}\n  I --&gt;|是| Z\n  I --&gt;|否| N</pre><p>四个概念只需一次定义，后面全部复用：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>作用对象</th>\n<th>判定输入</th>\n<th>是否改变结果</th>\n<th>失效主因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>双边累积</td>\n<td>对方成员的原产材料</td>\n<td>材料原产国 = 对方</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>材料无有效原产证明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对角累积</td>\n<td>共享同一套规则的第三方原产材料</td>\n<td>各方规则同源 + 证明互认</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>规则版本不一致、证明不互认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完全累积</td>\n<td>区内所有加工增值</td>\n<td>加工发生地 + 增值额</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>加工记录缺失、无区域价值台账</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>de minimis</td>\n<td>单个非原产材料</td>\n<td>从价额或重量</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>口径（FOB/EXW/净成本）选错</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"累积规则的三种形态与判定差异\">累积规则的三种形态与判定差异</h2><p><strong>双边累积（bilateral cumulation）<strong>是优惠协定的默认项：一方使用另一方原产的材料，视同使用本国原产材料。EU-UK 贸易与合作协定第 ORIG.4 条规定，原产于欧盟的货物在联合王国用作生产投入时，应视为原产于联合王国，反之亦然。它的判定极简——只需确认材料的原产国等于对方成员，不需比对双方规则文本，因为双方共用同一套规则。工程上唯一的坑是</strong>证明链</strong>：材料必须有原产声明或供应商声明支撑，否则&quot;声称原产于对方&quot;无法入账。</p>\n<p><strong>对角累积（diagonal cumulation）<strong>允许三方彼此借道，前提是它们</strong>共用同一套原产地规则</strong>且证明互相认可。欧盟-泛欧地中海（PEM）公约体系是典型：修订后的 PEM 规则于 2025 年 1 月 1 日起对签署方适用（来源：欧盟委员会 PEM 公约修订说明）。对角累积的判定多了一整个维度——引擎必须持有&quot;规则同源矩阵&quot;，逐对判断 A 国材料用在 B 国加工、再出口到 C 国时是否成立。<strong>这一维度无法用单条 PSR 表达</strong>，必须外置成一张可维护的协定两两关系表，这也是引擎服务化最直接的动机之一。</p>\n<p><strong>完全累积（full cumulation）<strong>最激进：区内发生的</strong>任何加工</strong>都计入区域价值，而不仅限于&quot;原产材料&quot;。欧洲经济区（EEA）协定第四议定书长期采用完全累积。它与对角累积的差别可量化——设区内加工增值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>proc</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{proc}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">proc</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、非原产材料价值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>VNM</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{VNM}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">VNM</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>V</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>diagonal</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>EXW</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>VNM</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>EXW</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>R</mi><mi>V</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>full</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>EXW</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>VNM</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>proc,other</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>EXW</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RVC_{\\text{diagonal}} = \\frac{V_{\\text{EXW}} - V_{\\text{VNM}}}{V_{\\text{EXW}}}, \\qquad RVC_{\\text{full}} = \\frac{V_{\\text{EXW}} - V_{\\text{VNM}} + V_{\\text{proc,other}}}{V_{\\text{EXW}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">diagonal</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">EXW</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">EXW</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">VNM</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">full</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">EXW</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">EXW</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">VNM</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">proc,other</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>完全累积的 RVC 分子更大。正因如此，欧盟 GSP 的区域累积（Regulation (EU) No 978/2012 第 II 编第 2 章）在特定地理集团内允许累积，但要求加工&quot;超出最小操作&quot;。对引擎而言，完全累积要求<strong>工厂级加工增值台账</strong>——这通常不在 ERP 里，而在 MES 或加工成本核算系统里，是资格引擎最贵的数据依赖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"de-minimis-阈值-两种口径与三种测度\">de minimis 阈值：两种口径与三种测度</h2><p>de minimis 的本质是一次<strong>条件豁免</strong>：非原产材料的价值或重量低于阈值时，即使 PSR 未满足，货物仍可判定原产。USMCA 第 4.6 条规定，除纺织品与服装外，非原产材料价值不超过货物成交价 <strong>10%</strong> 的货物仍视为原产；纺织品不用从价而用<strong>重量</strong>——非原产材料不超过决定税则归类的部件总重 <strong>10%</strong>（来源：USMCA 第 4.6 条，美国实施法规 19 CFR Part 182）。RCEP 采用 <strong>10% FOB</strong> 口径（来源：RCEP 第 3.5 条）。欧盟与 PEM 体系的标准容忍率为<strong>从价 15%</strong>（工业品以出厂价 EXW 为基数），农产品按<strong>重量 15%</strong>（来源：欧盟联合海关法典 UCC 第 69 条容忍规则）。</p>\n<p>三条工程结论：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>基数不统一是最大的计算分歧</strong>。同一批物料，以成交价（FOB）、出厂价（EXW）还是净成本作分母，算出的百分比不同，判定可能翻转。引擎必须把<strong>基数口径</strong>作为判定入参并落库，而不是硬编码默认值。</li>\n<li><strong>从价与按重量不可混用</strong>。纺织品按重量口径时，一个昂贵但极轻的饰件可能&quot;价值超标而重量不超标&quot;，从价逻辑会误判。HS 章级路由（61/62/63 章走重量）必须写进引擎的品类策略。</li>\n<li><strong>de minimis 通常不适用于整件货物</strong>——它豁免的是&quot;非原产材料&quot;，不是&quot;未满足的工序&quot;。多数协定还把 de minimis 的适用<strong>排除在</strong>特定章节（纺织品、部分农产品）之外，这份排除清单须与 PSR 表同源维护。</li>\n</ol>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>协定</th>\n<th>口径</th>\n<th>阈值</th>\n<th>基数</th>\n<th>排除</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>USMCA（非纺织）</td>\n<td>从价</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>成交价</td>\n<td>部分货物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>USMCA（纺织）</td>\n<td>按重量</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>决定归类的部件总重</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RCEP</td>\n<td>从价</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>FOB</td>\n<td>各成员保留清单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EU / PEM 标准规则</td>\n<td>从价（工业）/按重量（农）</td>\n<td>15%</td>\n<td>EXW / 产品重量</td>\n<td>特定章节</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"累积与-de-minimis-的交互顺序\">累积与 de minimis 的交互顺序</h2><p>把两者放进同一条流水线时，<strong>顺序是语义的一部分</strong>。正确顺序是&quot;先累积、后容忍&quot;：累积把材料<strong>升级为原产</strong>，从根源减少非原产材料池；de minimis 只对剩下的池子做豁免。若先做 de minimis，一个 8% 的日本零件会被直接抹除，它本可作为对待原产国材料的累积价值也被一并抹除，引擎会<strong>低估</strong>区域价值成分，产生假阴性。</p>\n<p>反过来还有更难缠的<strong>假阳性</strong>：某些协定规定，被 de minimis 豁免的非原产材料<strong>不得触发</strong>税则归类改变之外的其他 PSR 计算。也就是说，一个被容忍的零件，其 HS 编码不参与 CTC 比对——但它的价值是否仍计入 RVC 分子的扣减项，各协定写法不一。引擎必须把&quot;容忍零件的处置策略&quot;显式建模为三选一：完全忽略（既不比对编码也不扣减 RVC）、算价值不比对编码、或仅对 CTC 规则生效。这三条策略在同一协定内可能因品类而异，硬编码会在跨品类复用时报错。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  S[输入: BOM + 原产国 + HS + 价值] --&gt; C1[展开累积集合]&#10;  C1 --&gt; C2[重标区内原产材料]&#10;  C2 --&gt; C3[残余非原产材料池]&#10;  C3 --&gt; D1[选择 de minimis 口径]&#10;  D1 --&gt; D2{从价 or 重量?}&#10;  D2 --&gt;|从价| D3[与从价阈值比较]&#10;  D2 --&gt;|重量| D4[与重量阈值比较]&#10;  D3 --&gt; R[产出: 有效非原产价值 V_VNM_eff]&#10;  D4 --&gt; R&#10;  R --&gt; P[交 PSR 判定: CTC / RVC / 工艺]\">flowchart TD\n  S[输入: BOM + 原产国 + HS + 价值] --&gt; C1[展开累积集合]\n  C1 --&gt; C2[重标区内原产材料]\n  C2 --&gt; C3[残余非原产材料池]\n  C3 --&gt; D1[选择 de minimis 口径]\n  D1 --&gt; D2{从价 or 重量?}\n  D2 --&gt;|从价| D3[与从价阈值比较]\n  D2 --&gt;|重量| D4[与重量阈值比较]\n  D3 --&gt; R[产出: 有效非原产价值 V_VNM_eff]\n  D4 --&gt; R\n  R --&gt; P[交 PSR 判定: CTC / RVC / 工艺]</pre><h2 id=\"资格引擎服务化-接口-缓存与版本治理\">资格引擎服务化：接口、缓存与版本治理</h2><p>判定逻辑一旦稳定，剩下的就是把它做成<strong>可被订单、报价、清关三个系统同时调用的服务</strong>。核心设计点不多，但每个都直接决定正确性。</p>\n<p><strong>接口契约</strong>。判定请求应携带 SKU、当前 HS 版本、目标协定、启用的累积集合、以及判定基数的时点（价值与汇率会变）。响应不能只返回布尔值，而应返回<strong>决策记录</strong>：命中的 PSR 条目 ID、累积后的材料原产国重标结果、de minimis 的实测比值与所用阈值、以及结论。下游报价与清关申报都要引用它——它是审计追溯的唯一凭据，也是&quot;为什么这里算 0%&quot;的可解释性来源。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Decision</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">⟨</mo><mtext>verdict</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> psrId</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> cumulationSet</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> dmRatio</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> threshold</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>eval</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Decision}(q) = \\big\\langle \\text{verdict},\\ \\text{psrId},\\ \\text{cumulationSet},\\ \\text{dmRatio},\\ \\text{threshold},\\ t_{\\text{eval}} \\big\\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Decision</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">⟨</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">verdict</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">psrId</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cumulationSet</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dmRatio</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">threshold</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eval</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>缓存键 = 全部输入语义的哈希</strong>。资格判定是纯函数，极适合缓存，但键必须覆盖：每个投入品的原产国、HS 版本、协定 ID、累积集合版本、阈值版本、基数口径。漏掉任一维度都会产生&quot;改了原产国却仍命中旧结论&quot;的脏读。把这几项拼成规范化字符串再哈希，是最省事的正确做法。</p>\n<p><strong>重算触发</strong>依赖显式的失效事件源，而非 TTL。真正需要重算的是：投入品原产国变更、BOM 结构变更、HS 版本切换、协定规则修订（PEM 修订、升级议定书）、以及成本口径更新。TTL 会在这五类之外制造无谓重算，又在这五类之内留下过期结论。</p>\n<p><strong>版本治理</strong>最容易欠账。结论必须<strong>钉住</strong>计算时所用的规则版本，否则协定一改，历史单据无法复现。可行做法是把&quot;协定 × HS 版本 × 生效起止日&quot;的 PSR 表做成带时间维度的<strong>不可变快照</strong>，按业务日期选快照，而非读&quot;当前&quot;表。</p>\n<p><strong>幂等与批处理</strong>。批量判定（一次为上万 SKU 算资格）是常见需求，接口应支持幂等键，让重试不产生重复决策记录。判定本身无副作用，这正是它可以放心重放的原因。</p>\n<p>判定完成后，结论如何变成<strong>可被海关接受的单证</strong>（供应商声明、原产证、长期声明），见 <a href=\"../supplier-declaration-scale-documentation/\">供应商声明与规模化单证</a>；累积集合与协定关系的上游维护，见 <a href=\"../preference-regime-comparison-duty-model/\">优惠制度比较与关税模型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>累积改变国别，de minimis 改变计数</strong>：前者把投入品重标为区内原产，后者把残余非原产材料按阈值豁免，二者是顺序相邻的两道过滤器。</li>\n<li><strong>累积三种形态</strong>：双边（默认，只需核国别）、对角（需规则同源矩阵与互认证明）、完全（需工厂级加工增值台账），复杂度递增，数据依赖各不相同。</li>\n<li><strong>de minimis 的口径陷阱</strong>：基数（FOB/EXW/净成本）、测度（从价 vs 重量）、排除清单三者都必须作为入参入库，不能硬编码。</li>\n<li><strong>顺序不可颠倒</strong>：先累积后容忍；先容忍会低估区域价值，产生假阴性。</li>\n<li><strong>服务化锚点</strong>：返回决策记录而非布尔值；缓存键覆盖全部语义输入；重算由变更事件驱动而非 TTL；规则表按业务日期取不可变快照以保证结论可复现。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"累积规则、de minimis 阈值与 SKU 资格引擎服务化","id":"累积规则-de-minimis-阈值与-sku-资格引擎服务化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"累积规则的三种形态与判定差异","id":"累积规则的三种形态与判定差异"},{"level":2,"text":"de minimis 阈值：两种口径与三种测度","id":"de-minimis-阈值-两种口径与三种测度"},{"level":2,"text":"累积与 de minimis 的交互顺序","id":"累积与-de-minimis-的交互顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"资格引擎服务化：接口、缓存与版本治理","id":"资格引擎服务化-接口-缓存与版本治理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"区域价值成分（RVC）计算与 BOM 成本累计引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fta-preference-utilization-duty-savings-engineering/sku-origin-qualification-engine/rvc-bom-cost-accumulation-engine"},"next":{"title":"原产地声明类型与凭证模型（自证/机构证书/供应商声明）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fta-preference-utilization-duty-savings-engineering/supplier-declaration-scale-documentation/origin-declaration-type-evidence-model"}}